# Internal drafting and citation-audit notes are not release artifacts.
manuscript/vcrisp_synthetic_benchmark_tase_draft.md
manuscript/citation_verification.md

# Author-controlled metadata templates are kept locally until their required
# authorship and archival details have been verified.
CITATION.cff.template
zenodo.json.template
